Fortinet scores CVE-2026-44277 and CVE-2026-26083 at a CVSSv3 base of 9.8 with a temporal score of 9.1, the figure ENISA's EUVD records carry. Those records also list FortiAuthenticator 6.4.0 to 6.4.10 and FortiSandbox 4.2.1 to 4.2.8 as affected, branches Fortinet's advisories give no fix for, and FortiSandbox Cloud 23 and 24 and PaaS 21.3 to 23.4 must migrate to a fixed release; until FortiAuthenticator is upgraded, Fortinet's workaround is to disable API access on exposed interfaces.
